## Methodology

### Edge Calculation
- **Historical Probability**: Baseline from earnings transcript analysis ({{ historical_quarters }} quarters analyzed)
- **News Adjustment**: {{ "{:.0%}".format(metadata.configuration.news_weight) }} weight applied to recent news sentiment and relevance
- **Fair Value**: `historical_probability + (news_relevance/10 × news_weight × direction_multiplier)`
- **Edge**: `fair_value - market_price`

### Position Sizing
- **STRONG** (>20% edge): 25% base position size
- **MODERATE** (10-20% edge): 15% base position size
- **PASS** (<10% edge): 0% position size
{% if metadata.allocation.was_scaled %}
- **Scaling**: All positions scaled by {{ "{:.1%}".format(metadata.allocation.scale_factor) }} to meet {{ "{:.0%}".format(metadata.configuration.max_allocation) }} max allocation
{% endif %}

### Limit Order Strategy
- **Hybrid Maker/Taker**: Considers both bid (maker) and ask (taker) sides
- **Safety Rail**: Won't cross spreads wider than {{ "{:.1%}".format(metadata.configuration.max_spread_cross) }}
- **Target Price**: `min(fair_value - 0.05, best_bid + 0.02, best_ask - 0.02)`
- **Order Range**: Target ± 2 cents for flexibility

